        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Forest Time–a game in which turn-based tactical gameplay is made cozy and peaceful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a wide variety of tactical puzzles, charming characters, and a warm atmosphere. Carefully plan your actions to get everything done in a limited number of turns, or experiment and explore. The game doesn't punish mistakes, so you can learn by trying things out.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/9dbf5fb1b0a6dd89fa21887f96900cef.poster.avif?t=1788803985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/9dbf5fb1b0a6dd89fa21887f96900cef.webm?t=1788803985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/9dbf5fb1b0a6dd89fa21887f96900cef.mp4?t=1788803985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Family-friendly and cozy<br></li><li> Relaxed pacing<br></li><li> Turn-based gameplay with plenty of time to consider your actions and experiment<br></li><li> A variety of task-based puzzles that reward careful planning and clever use of the character's abilities<br></li><li> Distinct characters<br></li><li> Seasonal and thematic levels (including a Halloween set)</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/c436db429cdb8eca2d41d815f2cab085.avif?t=1788803985\" width=756 height=166 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Forest Time has to offer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. 50+ levels grouped in three sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. A variety of tactical tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. 8 playable characters, each with their own ability and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Short dialogues and stories to set up the atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Charming and minimalist visuals.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/17b120c55ab1dd22f2836d81b2dc3415.avif?t=1788803985\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras_big/17b120c55ab1dd22f2836d81b2dc3415.avif?t=1788803985 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/5919ecf4fe35c104f66821b06484a32e.poster.avif?t=1788803985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/5919ecf4fe35c104f66821b06484a32e.webm?t=1788803985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/5919ecf4fe35c104f66821b06484a32e.mp4?t=1788803985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What the game doesn't have</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that Forest Time has simplistic visual effects and sound design. We plan to enhance these aspects in future updates and add some quality-of-life improvements.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides that, Forest Time is first of all designed to be a puzzle-like tactical experience. It doesn't offer any of the following features:</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Character progression or leveling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Inventory or crafting systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Multiplayer or competitive modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Complex storylines or quests.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your feedback is highly appreciated</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest Time is an indie game made by a small team of enthusiastic people. We highly value your feedback and suggestions. Please feel free to reach out to us via our social media channels or use the Steam discussion forum to share your thoughts, ideas or issues. Feel free to e-mail us if you prefer.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Forest Time–a game in which turn-based tactical gameplay is made cozy and peaceful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a wide variety of tactical puzzles, charming characters, and a warm atmosphere. Carefully plan your actions to get everything done in a limited number of turns, or experiment and explore. The game doesn't punish mistakes, so you can learn by trying things out.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/9dbf5fb1b0a6dd89fa21887f96900cef.poster.avif?t=1788803985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/9dbf5fb1b0a6dd89fa21887f96900cef.webm?t=1788803985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/9dbf5fb1b0a6dd89fa21887f96900cef.mp4?t=1788803985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Family-friendly and cozy<br></li><li> Relaxed pacing<br></li><li> Turn-based gameplay with plenty of time to consider your actions and experiment<br></li><li> A variety of task-based puzzles that reward careful planning and clever use of the character's abilities<br></li><li> Distinct characters<br></li><li> Seasonal and thematic levels (including a Halloween set)</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/c436db429cdb8eca2d41d815f2cab085.avif?t=1788803985\" width=756 height=166 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Forest Time has to offer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. 50+ levels grouped in three sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. A variety of tactical tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. 8 playable characters, each with their own ability and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Short dialogues and stories to set up the atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Charming and minimalist visuals.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/17b120c55ab1dd22f2836d81b2dc3415.avif?t=1788803985\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras_big/17b120c55ab1dd22f2836d81b2dc3415.avif?t=1788803985 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/5919ecf4fe35c104f66821b06484a32e.poster.avif?t=1788803985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/5919ecf4fe35c104f66821b06484a32e.webm?t=1788803985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/5919ecf4fe35c104f66821b06484a32e.mp4?t=1788803985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What the game doesn't have</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that Forest Time has simplistic visual effects and sound design. We plan to enhance these aspects in future updates and add some quality-of-life improvements.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides that, Forest Time is first of all designed to be a puzzle-like tactical experience. It doesn't offer any of the following features:</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Character progression or leveling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Inventory or crafting systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Multiplayer or competitive modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Complex storylines or quests.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your feedback is highly appreciated</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest Time is an indie game made by a small team of enthusiastic people. We highly value your feedback and suggestions. Please feel free to reach out to us via our social media channels or use the Steam discussion forum to share your thoughts, ideas or issues. Feel free to e-mail us if you prefer.</p>",
